{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "bookCode": "RV10",
  "bookSlug": "rig-veda-book-10",
  "n": 153,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "refId": "RV10-153:1",
      "text": "translated by"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "refId": "RV10-153:2",
      "text": "1. SWAYING about, the Active Ones came nigh to Indra at his birth,",
      "original": "ईङ्खयन्तीरपस्युव इन्द्रं जातमुपासते ।",
      "translit": "īṅkhayantīrapasyuva indraṃ jātamupāsate |"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "refId": "RV10-153:3",
      "text": "And shared his great heroic might.",
      "original": "भेजानासः सुवीर्यम्",
      "translit": "bhejānāsaḥ suvīryam"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "refId": "RV10-153:4",
      "text": "2. Based upon strength and victory and power, O Indra is thy birth:",
      "original": "त्वमिन्द्र बलादधि सहसो जात ओजसः ।",
      "translit": "tvamindra balādadhi sahaso jāta ojasaḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "refId": "RV10-153:5",
      "text": "Thou, Mighty One, art strong indeed.",
      "original": "त्वं वृषन्वृषेदसि",
      "translit": "tvaṃ vṛṣanvṛṣedasi"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "refId": "RV10-153:6",
      "text": "3. Thou art the Vrtra-slayer, thou, Indra, hast spread the firmament:",
      "original": "त्वमिन्द्रासि वृत्रहा व्यन्तरिक्षमतिरः ।",
      "translit": "tvamindrāsi vṛtrahā vyantarikṣamatiraḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "refId": "RV10-153:7",
      "text": "Thou hast with might upheld the heavens.",
      "original": "उद्द्यामस्तभ्ना ओजसा",
      "translit": "uddyāmastabhnā ojasā"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "refId": "RV10-153:8",
      "text": "4. Thou, Indra, bearest in thine arms the lightning that accords with thee,",
      "original": "त्वमिन्द्र सजोषसमर्कं बिभर्षि बाह्वोः ।",
      "translit": "tvamindra sajoṣasamarkaṃ bibharṣi bāhvoḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "refId": "RV10-153:9",
      "text": "Whetting thy thunderbolt with might.",
      "original": "वज्रं शिशान ओजसा",
      "translit": "vajraṃ śiśāna ojasā"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "refId": "RV10-153:10",
      "text": "5. Thou, Indra, art preeminent over all creatures in thy might:",
      "original": "त्वमिन्द्राभिभूरसि विश्वा जातान्योजसा ।",
      "translit": "tvamindrābhibhūrasi viśvā jātānyojasā |"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "refId": "RV10-153:11",
      "text": "Thou hast pervaded every place.",
      "original": "स विश्वा भुव आभवः",
      "translit": "sa viśvā bhuva ābhavaḥ"
    }
  ]
}
